[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315053 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c768e14f-5c12-58a7-a2f6-c76213bf259b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12s}{{s}^{2}+144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313533} {:answer/id #uuid "da0c792d-19bb-5761-a855-22981a61e7f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313689} {:answer/id #uuid "ebfaea01-08ad-5f2d-b3c4-35c19ceb7293" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313860} {:answer/id #uuid "faf65d46-a67b-54cf-9a43-1928028845c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{{s}^{2}+144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313979} {:answer/id #uuid "ff66dd4e-ce1c-53e8-b03e-2493d92b1a66" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{{s}^{2}-144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314013}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "faf65d46-a67b-54cf-9a43-1928028845c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{{s}^{2}+144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313979} :answer-field/id #uuid "25c56102-996d-591d-9850-f3779725766d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314109} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b1e4833-125b-5275-9ddb-3e5a0c5c0ef5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312308} {:answer/id #uuid "4344e22b-2cf4-5526-888c-708789e7646f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312512} {:answer/id #uuid "4489bac6-a751-5770-af18-c4d31a4dbca6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge 12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312526} {:answer/id #uuid "bdd90533-3806-5a8d-9c20-c624b5340f89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313463} {:answer/id #uuid "da8bac94-2af9-5d4f-bb9e-888341b229c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge -12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313690} {:answer/id #uuid "fe5260cf-2b88-59f4-aca6-f8fbf7c13e70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314004}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fe5260cf-2b88-59f4-aca6-f8fbf7c13e70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314004} :answer-field/id #uuid "e23a6d1f-5fa6-5ea0-84c7-199794933e97" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314633}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e8a3cfa3-5dd8-5a89-8d0e-84651dbd2d63" :question/math-academy-id "q-341127" :question/problem "Use the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}$ to find the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t).$$\\,L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t)}=$ {{field-1}},\ndefined for {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "The linearity property of the Laplace transform states that for functions $f(t)$ and $g(t),$ we have\n\n$$\nL{\\alpha f(t)+\\beta g(t)}=\\alpha \\cdot L{f(t)}+\\beta \\cdot L{g(t)},\n$$\n\nwhere $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $ are constants.\n\nFirst, recall that the sine function can be defined in terms of complex exponentials as follows: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t)=\\frac{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}-{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}\n$$\n\nTaking the Laplace transform and applying the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t)} & =L{\\frac{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}-{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}-\\frac{{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}}-L{\\frac{{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}}{2\\text{i}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}L{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}}-\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}L{{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we recall that \n\n$$\nL{{e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}}=\\frac{1}{s-\\text{i}\\omega },\\,s>0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s-12\\text{i}},\\,s>0 \\\\ L{{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s+12\\text{i}},\\,s>0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12t)} & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}L{{e}^{12\\text{i}t}}-\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}L{{e}^{-12\\text{i}t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s-12\\text{i}}-\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+12\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}(\\frac{1}{s-12\\text{i}}-\\frac{1}{s+12\\text{i}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}(\\frac{(s+12\\text{i})-(s-12\\text{i})}{(s-12\\text{i})(s+12\\text{i})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}}(\\frac{24\\text{i}}{{s}^{2}+144}) \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{{s}^{2}+144},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ndefined for $s>0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315054 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14436da6-7b8c-5459-99b4-6bfac4ea557e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5s}{{s}^{2}+25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312115} {:answer/id #uuid "1d9e4cdb-da70-58c7-89af-e8d816e8118a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{{s}^{2}-25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312197} {:answer/id #uuid "6a67d383-8250-5a1a-90d2-d860785ccd1f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{{s}^{2}+25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312811} {:answer/id #uuid "e0a5bb4c-e052-588c-8333-00b1ec43ae2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313742} {:answer/id #uuid "f4191730-dc53-522b-bd9c-0a28f4609b05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e0a5bb4c-e052-588c-8333-00b1ec43ae2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+25}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313742} :answer-field/id #uuid "8bd9d091-035d-5977-ba5e-edd708d5f7ff" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314383} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f877140-44e1-512e-aa01-58a47c03d18a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312212} {:answer/id #uuid "5787223e-84df-5b67-8318-493beb86482a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312680} {:answer/id #uuid "5d707f3b-b3d7-52ed-8c43-aff476c90d11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312722} {:answer/id #uuid "6f0cd83e-16f9-5e10-8198-cb4268d7ac22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312849} {:answer/id #uuid "c190ebbe-c34f-57a2-84bb-70203879f609" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge -5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313489} {:answer/id #uuid "d70e6448-340a-5c5d-bb7d-9a3c9421077e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s\\ge 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313669}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5787223e-84df-5b67-8318-493beb86482a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312680} :answer-field/id #uuid "a7d45f06-6418-52b0-822f-68bc8cdb0326" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314460}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c15c9946-0f44-5115-b665-0c4efd18e05a" :question/math-academy-id "q-341137" :question/problem "Use the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}$ to find the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t).$$\\,L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)}=$ {{field-1}},\ndefined for {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "The linearity property of the Laplace transform states that for functions $f(t)$ and $g(t),$ we have\n\n$$\nL{\\alpha f(t)+\\beta g(t)}=\\alpha \\cdot L{f(t)}+\\beta \\cdot L{g(t)},\n$$\n\nwhere $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $ are constants.\n\nFirst, recall that the cosine function can be defined in terms of complex exponentials as follows: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)=\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}+{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}\n$$\n\nTaking the Laplace transform and applying the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}+{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}{2}+\\frac{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}{2}}+L{\\frac{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}+\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we recall that \n\n$$\nL{{e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}}=\\frac{1}{s-\\text{i}\\omega },\\,s>0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}},\\,s>0 \\\\ L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}},\\,s>0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} & =\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}+\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}}+\\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{(s+5\\text{i})+(s-5\\text{i})}{(s-5\\text{i})(s+5\\text{i})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{2s}{{s}^{2}+25}) \\\\  & =\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+25},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ndefined for $s>0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315056 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d0c4566c-bd79-5868-a603-18f0216abcb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{x}}{1+{x}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313607}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d0c4566c-bd79-5868-a603-18f0216abcb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{x}}{1+{x}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313607} :answer-field/id #uuid "183d9fe6-f1f2-5fd2-b79e-60dbadd9be0a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314073}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c596781e-b79d-5304-abff-1db8b7bfbe7e" :question/math-academy-id "q-341146" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={e}^{x}\\cdot arccot\\,x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}\\cdot arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})\\cdot arccot\\,x+{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x+{e}^{x}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x-\\frac{{e}^{x}}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315057 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08831fa4-e925-511e-9c83-0ad4ccc9d162" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{log}_{4}x}{1+{x}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312036}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08831fa4-e925-511e-9c83-0ad4ccc9d162" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{log}_{4}x}{1+{x}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312036} :answer-field/id #uuid "b52cc14c-ea3a-52a9-8673-3631dde0a4af" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314499}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "88e0b1bd-ab5b-5056-934f-dc0524e7e997" :question/math-academy-id "q-341147" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot arccot\\,x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{arccot\\,x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{4}⁡x)\\cdot arccot\\,x+{log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\cdot arccot\\,x+{log}_{4}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot\\,x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡x}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315060 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65d81e41-d413-5bdc-bac8-be87aebb35d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312778}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65d81e41-d413-5bdc-bac8-be87aebb35d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312778} :answer-field/id #uuid "283a6be5-839d-5ff0-9bb5-4cf7f3cc3f25" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314116} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "371c6c74-0468-5c9c-b71f-5ca91630b4ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312419}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "371c6c74-0468-5c9c-b71f-5ca91630b4ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312419} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c25f5fd-d7bd-5f84-a472-da9da0020049" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314435}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "61288950-c35e-5f57-a1be-6d007672017d" :question/math-academy-id "q-341179" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{arccsc\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)={3}^{x}$ and $v(x)=arccsc\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\cdot arccsc\\,x-{3}^{x}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}. \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{arccsc\\,x}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315065 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46fdc275-923c-5cd3-a59b-4a658e3f4258" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{s}^{2}{F}^{″}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312553} {:answer/id #uuid "84e3b5f2-d37c-5878-a054-dc9361627378" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{s}^{2}{F}^{″}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313042} {:answer/id #uuid "aa724df4-aed9-56b9-b407-2a2e5a522b9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{F}^{″}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313312} {:answer/id #uuid "b4df4b8f-9398-5c59-ba04-dacf1a61413f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{F}^{″}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313383} {:answer/id #uuid "c3994cd8-7571-5ad3-a21b-c67bb4e8415b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{s}^{2}{F}^{′}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313509}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b4df4b8f-9398-5c59-ba04-dacf1a61413f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{F}^{″}(s)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313383} :answer-field/id #uuid "072ef1bc-6e04-55a4-b9ac-23763a27d11a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 1759218631