" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313370}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20a21059-d54f-551e-9471-37938846fab3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312223} :answer-field/id #uuid "92b0b6b0-3213-508a-a594-6b878519058c" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314405} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ec5e059-a372-5ee6-a9ca-b72ae0e49495" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{s}^{3}+32s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312346} {:answer/id #uuid "6a94e5f4-2a5c-576f-ada0-118b77c74565" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312812} {:answer/id #uuid "ba16dbd1-da4e-5df4-8ce6-122d14f5c5d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{2{s}^{3}+32s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313425} {:answer/id #uuid "fe59aa68-ce10-51bf-a902-d1f9264f9d29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314005}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fe59aa68-ce10-51bf-a902-d1f9264f9d29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314005} :answer-field/id #uuid "d28f2095-fdf6-5b95-93c2-162bb3d5a558" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314588}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7344131a-f847-5800-9b21-f09ea79674c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-341216" :question/problem "Suppose we wish to calculate the Laplace transform \n\n$$\nL{{t}^{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4t}.\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below. You may make use of the following result:\n\n$$\nL{\\operatorname{cosh}⁡\\omega t}=\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-{\\omega }^{2}},\\,s>\\omega .\n$$\n\nLet $f(t)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4t$ and $F(s)=L{f(t)}.$ By the smoothness property of Laplace transforms, we have\n\n$$\nL{{t}^{2}f(t)}={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nThe Laplace transform of $f(t)$ is\n\n$$\nF(s)=L{f(t)}={{field-2}},\\,s>4.\n$$\n\nWe have that\n\n$$\n{F}^{″}(s)={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nL{{t}^{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4t}={{field-4}},\\,s>4.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a function $f(t)$ is piecewise continuous on $[0,\\infty )$ and has exponential order $a,$ then its Laplace transform\n\n$$\nF(s)=L{f(t)}\n$$\n\nexists for every real $s>a,$ and $F$ is infinitely differentiable in this region of convergence. Moreover, for each integer $n\\ge 0$ and every such $s,$ we have\n\n$$\nL{{t}^{n}f(t)}=(-1)^{n}{F}^{(n)}(s).\n$$\n\nIn particular, for $n=2,$ we have\n\n$$\nL{{t}^{2}f(t)}={F}^{″}(s).\n$$\n\nWe have that $f(t)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4t.$ Using the given result with $\\omega =4,$ the Laplace transform of $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nF(s)=\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-16},\\,s>4.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating with respect to $s,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{F}^{′}(s) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-16}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(s({s}^{2}-16)^{-1}) \\\\  & =({s}^{2}-16)^{-1}+s(-({s}^{2}-16)^{-2}\\cdot 2s) \\\\  & =\\frac{{s}^{2}-16}{({s}^{2}-16)^{2}}-\\frac{2{s}^{2}}{({s}^{2}-16)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{s}^{2}+16}{({s}^{2}-16)^{2}} \\\\ {F}^{″}(s) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(-\\frac{{s}^{2}+16}{({s}^{2}-16)^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(\\frac{{s}^{2}+16}{({s}^{2}-16)^{2}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{({s}^{2}+16)^{′}\\cdot ({s}^{2}-16)^{2}-({s}^{2}+16)\\cdot {(({s}^{2}-16)^{2})}^{′}}{({s}^{2}-16)^{4}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{(2s)({s}^{2}-16)^{2}-({s}^{2}+16)\\cdot 2({s}^{2}-16)\\cdot 2s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{4}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2s({s}^{2}-16)^{2}-4s({s}^{2}+16)({s}^{2}-16)}{({s}^{2}-16)^{4}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2s({s}^{2}-16)-4s({s}^{2}+16)}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2{s}^{3}-32s-4{s}^{3}-64s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we used the quotient rule to find ${F}^{″}(s).$\n\nTherefore, by the smoothness property,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{t}^{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4t}={F}^{″}(s)=\\frac{2{s}^{3}+96s}{({s}^{2}-16)^{3}},\\,s>4.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315066 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26ff3440-ff04-5bfd-8fc1-687bd5f7d123" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{{s}^{2}-36}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312269} {:answer/id #uuid "3970154d-ce4b-5800-be35-0be84aafe76e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{{s}^{2}-36}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312442} {:answer/id #uuid "7bafb52e-ec26-51b8-aad3-c2573738b82f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-36}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312965} {:answer/id #uuid "8bddb1f0-0b49-58eb-b758-5eeed60b541f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-36}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313094}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26ff3440-ff04-5bfd-8fc1-687bd5f7d123" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{{s}^{2}-36}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312269} :answer-field/id #uuid "46605232-552f-5771-8072-5ed48fd527af" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186